#: ../guide/concepts.md:141 9fdbf7993f2b4a85a7d08b8f4525b5ac
msgid "Key design choices (and why)"
msgstr ""

#: ../guide/concepts.md:143 f8d65e8841964188b5404e8464debd40
msgid ""
"**Event-loop, not vectorized.** Strategy code reads like real trading "
"logic (`if x then buy`). Easier to write, easier to debug. Slower than "
"vectorbt for huge sweeps — see "
"[COMPARISON.md](https://github.com/gguan/qtrade/blob/main/COMPARISON.md)."
msgstr ""

#: ../guide/concepts.md:146 44521fb4ea4e44e6aeb89017f395174d
msgid ""
"**No look-ahead by construction.** `self.data` is sliced to "
"`[:current_time]`. You literally cannot read future bars from inside "
"`on_bar_close()`."
msgstr ""

#: ../guide/concepts.md:149 c4e7dd73731f4750b63099feab58b9ff
msgid ""
"**One cash pool, per-asset positions.** Multi-asset backtests get "
"realistic portfolio behavior (margin shared across assets) without having"
" to manage N independent brokers."
msgstr ""

#: ../guide/concepts.md:152 e90ec7e4872a453e9b8a0170d648ce1a
msgid ""
"**Strategy + RL share one Broker.** Same accounting code, same SL/TP "
"logic, same fill semantics. An RL agent in `TradingEnv` is governed by "
"exactly the same rules as a `Strategy` in `Backtest`."
msgstr ""

